 most effective strategies for securing your APIs.</p><h3 data-testid=3D"te=
xt-treatment-18c067407779" class=3D"d-sub-section mt-6 mb-3">The rise of AP=
Is</h3><p data-testid=3D"text-treatment-b4f1939f6a57" class=3D"d-body-base =
mb-4">To understand why APIs are so important to modern app development, it=
 helps to compare how applications were traditionally built versus how they=
 are engineered today. Traditional web applications were often monolithic, =
consisting of thousands of lines of tightly coupled =E2=80=9Cspaghetti code=
.=E2=80=9D Any update or change to the application requires modifying large=
 sections of the code, making development slow, complex, and more error-pro=
ne.</p><p data-testid=3D"text-treatment-4149dbf31d54" class=3D"d-body-base =
mb-4">In contrast, modern web applications are typically made up of indepen=
dent, modular components=E2=80=94or microservices=E2=80=94that communicate =
via APIs with each other and/or with an application front end, either web o=
r mobile. Each component can be developed, deployed, and scaled separately,=
 and developers can reuse existing services from internal teams or third-pa=
rty providers rather than building everything from scratch. APIs simplify a=
nd speed up development cycles in the creation of applications, enabling fa=
ster iteration based on user feedback, integration of third-party services,=
 and more scalable applications that are easy to manage.</p><p data-testid=
=3D"text-treatment-c3732a9a7356" class=3D"d-body-base mb-4">APIs are so fou=
ndational to modern app development that organizations are increasingly tak=
ing an <a href=3D"https://www.f5.com/glossary/api-first" class=3D"text-prim=
ary hover:text-carbon underline hover:no-underline underline-offset-2 break=
-words font-semibold">API-first</a> approach, where the design of applicati=
ons starts with the API. This has led to a proliferation of APIs: <a href=
=3D"https://cdn.studio.f5.com/files/k6fem79d/production/ed7969d007d67889118=
ac60aaf50e129ac2ab4bb.pdf" target=3D"_self" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" cla=
ss=3D"text-primary hover:text-carbon underline hover:no-underline underline=
